{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32428","headline":"寒食节日寄楚望二首 一 · 温庭筠","name":"寒食节日寄楚望二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳兰无意绿，弱柳何穷缕。\n心断入淮山，梦长穿楚雨。\n繁花如二八，好月当三五。\n愁碧竟平臯，韶红换幽圃。\n流莺隐员树，乳燕喧余哺。\n旷望恋曾台，离忧集环堵。\n当年不自遣，晚得终何补。\n郑谷有樵苏，归来要腰斧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}